## TDZ check (APP-SPLIT-003C lesson)

The deps object is built inline at the useCaptureWiring call, placed at the
earliest point where every referenced binding is in scope (pronDemo's state
+ demo effect sit immediately above; everything else is declared earlier in
the body). Reads are handler-time only: the hook's own effects read the
destructured values after mount, and every other reader is a click/JSX
handler — no mount-time async IIFE in App awaits anything from this slice
before the render frame assigns the bundle.

