— untouched. No test/journey file references any moved function name
(playBlobUrl/recordAttempt/stopAndCheck/analyze*/fetch*/open*/new*/
playReference/newDictationSentence/captureRouteRef). The primitives
re-export shim block is unchanged (the pruned packAttemptRequest/toWav16/
toB64 were plain imports, not shim exports).

